---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-border mt-16">
  <div class="container py-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
    <p>Your files never leave your browser. Nothing is uploaded, nothing is stored.</p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
      <span>&copy; {year} WhatsInMyPDF</span>
      <a href="/privacy" class="underline">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms" class="underline">Terms</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/whatsinmypdf/whatsinmypdf"
        class="underline"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank">Source on GitHub</a
      >
      <span>Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
